{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"kind":"article","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"IssuingSDKDocs"}],"title":"A Starting Guide (Sessions)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK into your iOS application."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Card Provisioning Sessions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Card Sessions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Prerequisites","anchor":"Prerequisites","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before you begin, you must obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Embed the Certificate","anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Fetch a Session Token","anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to fetch this token for the specific payment instruments."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Perform a ","type":"text"},{"code":"POST","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request to the following endpoint:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Environment"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"URL"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Test"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/test.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Live"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/authe-live.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions"}]}]]]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Headers:"}]}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Content-Type: application\/json"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X-API-Key: YOUR_API_KEY"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body:"}]}]},{"syntax":"json","type":"codeListing","code":["{","    \"product\": \"platform\",","    \"policy\": {","        \"resources\": [","            {","                \"type\": \"paymentInstrument\",","                \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"...\"","            }","        ],","        \"roles\": [\"...\"]","    }","}"]},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The required ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roles"},{"type":"text","text":" depend on the SDK feature you are using. See the feature-specific documentation for details."}]}],"style":"note"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend should receive the session token and pass it to your iOS application.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Import-the-SDK","text":"Import the SDK"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the appropriate import statements at the top of your Swift files:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import CardProvisioningSessions","import IssuingCommon"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This gives you access to all public types, including ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Configuration"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProvisioningSession"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not import "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore"},{"type":"text","text":" directly. It is an internal dependency that is required at link time but has no public API for integrators."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"text":"Implement a Token Provider","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Implement-a-Token-Provider"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your app needs an object that conforms to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"text":" protocol. This object is responsible for supplying the session token fetched in the previous step.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import IssuingCommon","","class TokenProvider: TokenProviding {","    func retrieveToken(for paymentInstrumentIds: Set<String>) async throws -> String {","        \/\/ Implement the logic to retrieve the session token for the given","        \/\/ payment instrument IDs from your backend and return it.","        let sessionToken = \"...\"","        return sessionToken","    }","}","","let tokenProvider = TokenProvider()"]},{"text":"Device Testing Requirements","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Device-Testing-Requirements"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK requires a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Release build on a physical device"}]},{"text":" for full end-to-end functionality. Use TestFlight to distribute Release builds to testers. The iOS Simulator is suitable for UI development and integration work, but provisioning flows cannot complete on the Simulator.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Next-Steps","level":2,"text":"Next Steps"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once you have completed the common setup, proceed to the feature-specific guide:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardProvisioningGuide","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" — Understand the two provisioning approaches and choose the right one for your architecture"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/SessionsProvisioningGuide"},{"type":"text","text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet using the session-based API (recommended)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/OfflineProvisioningGuide"},{"type":"text","text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet with direct control over each provisioning step"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardSessionsGuide"},{"type":"text","text":" — Reveal card details, reveal PIN, change PIN (Work in Progress)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/issuingsdkdocs\/gettingstar